/* ipv6header match - matches IPv6 packets based
   on whether they contain certain headers */

/* Original idea: Brad Chapman 
 * Rewritten by: Andras Kis-Szabo <kisza@sch.bme.hu> */

/* (C) 2001-2002 Andras Kis-Szabo <kisza@sch.bme.hu>
